        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "086DA75945746038",
      "text": "Vous êtes m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0B07)]onsieurademoiselle [VAR 0x0100(0000)],\\nje présume ?[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0B07"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "086DA859457461EB",
      "text": "Je suis sincèrement navré pour l’arrivée si tardive\\nde vos documents d’inscription.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "086DAD5945746A6A",
      "text": "Laissez-moi me présenter.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "086DAE5945746C1D",
      "text": "Je me nomme monsieur Clavel.\\nJe suis le proviseur de l’Académie Orange.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "08712E5945777B74",
      "text": "Je me nomme monsieur Clavel.\\nJe suis le proviseur de l’Académie Raisin.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_01",
      "hash64": "CEBAA8BB4FF1BD84",
      "text": "Vous êtes le proviseur ?! Et vous êtes venu\\npersonnellement chercher m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0707)]on filsa fille ?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0707"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "086DAB5945746704",
      "text": "C’est la moindre des choses.\\c\\nLe proviseur est le premier responsable\\ndes bévues de son académie, après tout.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "086DAC59457468B7",
      "text": "Voici pour vous. À l’intérieur, vous trouverez\\nles documents d’inscription ainsi qu’un plan\\r\\nde l’établissement.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_02",
      "hash64": "CEBAABBB4FF1C29D",
      "text": "Vous vous êtes déplacé spécialement pour ça ?\\nOh, il ne fallait pas...[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_03",
      "hash64": "CEBAAABB4FF1C0EA",
      "text": "Mais puisque vous êtes là, laissez-moi au moins\\nvous offrir quelque chose à boire.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0040_head_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "086DA15945745606",
      "text": "Oh non, je n’oserais m’imposer...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_04",
      "hash64": "CEBAA5BB4FF1B86B",
      "text": "Mon cœur ! Maman doit parler un instant avec\\nmonsieur le proviseur.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0040_mama_05",
      "hash64": "CEBAA4BB4FF1B6B8",
      "text": "Va donc finir de te préparer pour l’école [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]dans[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]ta chambre[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], tu veux bien ?\\c\\nCe serait bête d’oublier ton sac et ton chapeau\\npour ton premier jour ![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
